   "note": "Coevolutionary agent-based civilization simulation on a mappa world (worker civ, custom_domain civ.mino.mobi). / is the WORLD-ENGINE HUB — landing page over the whole suite (civ dashboard at /dash/, playback/development/FRED subpages, and cross-links to mappa, polis, rite/names, rite/org); unification strategy in civ/STRATEGY.md. Headless-first engine in mappa/civ/… Facts Machine-readable entry: deploy-registry.json → surfaces[] where surface == \"civ\". How it works Coevolutionary agent-based civilization simulation on a mappa world (worker civ, custom_domain civ.mino.mobi). / is the WORLD-ENGINE HUB — landing page over the whole suite (civ dashboard at /dash/, playback/development/FRED subpages, and cross-links to mappa, polis, rite/names, rite/org); unification strategy in civ/STRATEGY.md. Headless-first engine in mappa/civ/; CORS-open no-key API /api/civ/run + /api/civ/sweep + /api/civ/sites (the civ→polis foundings handoff). Names spoken by rite/names culture packs (mappa/civ/names.js — hence rite/names/engine.js in paths). Bundles mappa/engine.js. No secrets, no D1.",
