     "desc": "Borsuk's 1933 partition conjecture. Every bounded subset of ℝd splits into d+1 pieces of strictly smaller diameter — easy in 2D and 3D, false in dim 1325 (Kahn–Kalai 1993), and still false in dim 64 (Jenrich 2014). 2D demo + the dimension-race timeline showing the threshold shrinking over 21 years.",
