   "desc": "An infinite whiteboard that contains infinite whiteboards. Pictures, voice notes, links and text snips placed in space and wired together with arrows; fold a crowded corner into a child board and the arrows that crossed the boundary re-point at the portal. One board is one record in your own repo.",
