   "desc": "Harvestople — farming on ATProto. Plant real organisms that grow on the wall clock, mine the seven planetary metals, brew Galenic alchemy from what you harvest, and post your deeds to Bluesky. Friends who water your plants grow them 10% faster each — every boost a public record either side can verify. Your whole farm is one record in your own repo; no database anywhere.",
