   "desc": "Words with friends, without the ads or the accounts. One to four seats, any of them a deterministic bot that reads a 168,551-word lexicon through a DAWG. The board is the new part: beside the usual double and triple squares there are quad letters, mires that pay nothing, halves that cut a word in two after every multiplier, tolls that tax the filler move, and stones — holes that words break on like the edge of the board. Installs as a PWA and plays offline against the bots.",
