   "desc": "An AppView with no database. Jetstream v2 filters the firehose to your follow graph server-side, so a live timeline needs no backend and no fan-out — and Constellation, the network-wide backlink index, answers the like/repost/reply counts a client normally has to ask an AppView for. Starts empty and fills as the network posts; nothing is stored anywhere.",
